            <ArticleTitle>Plasma morphine levels produced by continuous infusion in children.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>753-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Blood samples were taken from six children aged between 10 months and 15 years, at intervals over a period of 40 hours while they were receiving continuous morphine infusions. The plasma morphine values obtained showed similar and consistent levels 15-30 minutes after starting the infusions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
